listitem.para:
ACTION, DEVPATH,
        KERNEL, SYMLINK, NAME,
        ENV{}, TAG, SUBSYSTEM,
        DRIVER, ATTR{} and SYSCTL{}
        as match keys;

OWNER, GROUP and
        MODE, first the ones whose value is resolved only when the rule is
        applied (see below), then the others;

Search the devpath upwards for a device with matching tag. If the operator is
            !=, the token returns true only if there is no tag matched.
            The current tags of the devices are matched, see TAG below;
            for a device whose database entry was written by an older version of udev,
            which did not keep the tags of earlier events, all its tags.
